# Design Tokens

- Tokens in `src/index.css` `@theme` — page, ink, muted, line, brand
- Prefer `bg-page`, `text-ink`, `text-muted`, `border-line`, `bg-brand` over `#FAF9F5` etc.
- UI primitives: `src/components/ui/Button`, `Card`, `Modal`, `Badge`
- Role colors: `src/lib/status-colors.ts`
- Portal radius: `rounded-card` (28px) / `rounded-card-lg` (32px)
- Display font: `font-display` (Playfair Display)
